+        "reference algorithm builds all m^2 exact pair compatibilities in "
+        "O(m^3) permutation-image operations and applies Hopcroft-Karp in "
+        "O(m^(5/2)); at the shipping m=75 preset it performs about 0.77 million "
+        "counted exact operations in under one second, while the construction-index "
+        "route uses at most 3m+8=233 exact modular operations."
+    ),
