+
+## Use
+
+```python
+import random
+import gen_2412_13392 as g
+
+inst = g.make_instance(seed=7, **g.DIFFICULTY[g.SHIPPING_DIFFICULTY])
+statement = g.render(inst)
+candidate = g.parse_answer("<answer>...</answer>")
+ok, reason = g.verify(inst, candidate)
